<title>NEW ZEALAND: BNZ cuts NZ two, three and four yr fixed rates.</title>
<headline>BNZ cuts NZ two, three and four yr fixed rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of New Zealand on Tuesday said it had cut its two-year fixed rate housing loan to 9.5 percent from 9.75 percent, effective Wednesday, November 20.</p>
<p>BNZ said it had also cut is three and four-year fixed rates to 8.95 percent from 9.25 percent.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
